<figcaption id="achievement-figure-caption"><strong>Original constructed teaching illustration.</strong> The shield carries the armorial design. Crest, wreath, helmet, mantling, supporters, compartment, and motto are separate components; depicting them does not establish an armiger's legal right to bear them. Read the <a href="/achievement/">comparative achievement course</a> and try the <a href="/achievement/laboratory/">interactive anatomy laboratory</a>.</figcaption>
